
## Bitcoin Price API Requests

### Get Bitcoin Price in USD from CoinGecko
GET {{base-url}}/bitcoin/price?currency=USD&source=coingecko
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{x-api-key}}

### Get Bitcoin Price in EUR from Binance
GET {{base-url}}/bitcoin/price?currency=EUR&source=binance
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{x-api-key}}

### Get Bitcoin Price from all sources
GET {{base-url}}/bitcoin/prices?currency=USD
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{x-api-key}}
